## Building an RPG Battle System

### Character Setup

```xiom
type Character {
  name: Str;
  hp: Int;
  max_hp: Int;
  attack_min: Int;
  attack_max: Int;
}

fn create_hero() -> Character {
  Character{ name: "Hero", hp: 100, max_hp: 100, attack_min: 15, attack_max: 25 }
}

fn create_dragon() -> Character {
  Character{ name: "Dragon", hp: 150, max_hp: 150, attack_min: 10, attack_max: 20 }
}
```

### Attack Logic

```xiom
fn calculate_damage(attacker: &Character, seed: &mut Int) -> Int {
  seed = (seed * 1103515245 + 12345) % 2147483648;
  let range = attacker.attack_max - attacker.attack_min + 1;
  attacker.attack_min + (seed % range)
}

fn attack(attacker: &Character, defender: &mut Character, seed: &mut Int) {
  let damage = calculate_damage(attacker, seed);
  defender.hp -= damage;
  if defender.hp < 0 { defender.hp = 0; };
  io.println(attacker.name);
  io.println(damage);
}
```

### Healing

```xiom
fn heal(target: &mut Character, seed: &mut Int) {
  seed = (seed * 1103515245 + 12345) % 2147483648;
  let amount = 10 + (seed % 11);
  target.hp += amount;
  if target.hp > target.max_hp { target.hp = target.max_hp; };
}
```

### Battle Loop

```xiom
fn battle() -> Str {
  let mut hero = create_hero();
  let mut dragon = create_dragon();
  let mut seed = 42;
  let mut turn = 0;

  while hero.hp > 0 && dragon.hp > 0 {
    turn += 1;

    attack(&hero, &mut dragon, &mut seed);
    if dragon.hp <= 0 { return "Hero wins!"; };

    attack(&dragon, &mut hero, &mut seed);
    if hero.hp <= 0 { return "Dragon wins!"; };
  };

  "Battle ended."
}
```

